  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NZP+ Hammermill Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The group proposes to construct a hammer mill house and install the mill and maintain its operations for the surrounding community. Salaries for one maintenance operator and one security guard have been budgeted in the IGAs operating costs as well as security. The nearest hammer mill is 10 kilometers East and 15 kilometers West of the project site. Profits would go towards additional projects for vegetables gardens and a chicken project.</narrative>
  </description>
